<p>This policy explains which data Hauling Manager processes, why, for how long, and how to exercise your rights under the
    General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). Data controller: the site publisher (see the
    <a href="{{ path('legal_notice') }}">legal notice</a>). No data is sold, rented or used for advertising.</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Data we process</h2>
<div class="table-responsive">
    <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
        <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">What</th><th scope="col">Why (legal basis)</th><th scope="col">How long</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td>Account: email, password (hashed, never readable), registration date</td><td>Providing the service you asked for (contract)</td><td>Until the account is deleted</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Tours, missions, quantities, progress and mission durations</td><td>Providing the service (contract)</td><td>Until you delete them, or the account</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Without an account: random token in the <code>hauling_guest</code> cookie, linked to your tour</td><td>Finding your tour again without an account (contract)</td><td>1 year (cookie)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Error reports: message, category and a copy of the tour concerned (no email)</td><td>Fixing the planner (legitimate interest)</td><td>Until fixed, at most 2 years</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Contact messages: category, message, language, and your email only if you give it</td><td>Answering and improving the tool (legitimate interest)</td><td>Until handled, at most 2 years</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Audience measurement: page views and clicks, cookie-free</td><td>Knowing which features are used (legitimate interest)</td><td>Aggregated statistics</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Bot protection: IP address and technical browser signals when a form is sent</td><td>Security of the service (legitimate interest)</td><td>Duration of the check</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Cookies and local storage</h2>
<ul>
    <li><code>PHPSESSID</code> (session): sign-in and chosen language. Necessary, removed when the session ends.</li>
    <li><code>hauling_guest</code> (1 year): finds the tour of a visitor without an account. Necessary for the service.</li>
    <li><code>hm-theme</code> (browser local storage): light or dark theme. Never leaves your browser.</li>
</ul>
<p>These are strictly necessary and exempt from consent. No advertising or cross-site tracking cookie is set.</p>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Processors and third parties</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Hosting</strong>: Personal server of the publisher, located in France. Contact: <a href="{{ path('contact') }}">contact page</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Umami</strong> (self-hosted, cookie-free analytics): your browser only talks to this site, which forwards the IP
        address and browser to our own Umami instance to count visits. Umami does not keep the IP address, only an anonymous
        hash that is renewed regularly.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> (Cloudflare, Inc., USA): bot check on sign-in, registration and contact. Transfer
        outside the EU covered by the EU–US Data Privacy Framework. See
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's policy</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Your rights</h2>
<p>You have the right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability and objection.</p>
<ul>
    <li>With an account, the <strong>Profile</strong> page lets you change your email and <strong>delete the account</strong>:
        tours, missions and history are erased immediately; your contact messages are kept but made anonymous (account and reply email removed).</li>
    <li>Without an account, clearing this site's cookies detaches your tour from your browser.</li>
    <li>For any other request: <a href="{{ path('contact') }}">contact page</a>. Answer within one month.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you believe your rights are not respected, you can lodge a complaint with your data protection authority (in France,
    the CNIL: <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en/complaints" rel="noopener">cnil.fr</a>).</p>
